  "limitations": [
    "One experiment, two runs, four fixed run-temperature strata; within-block joint bootstrap conditional on these strata. No generalization of temperature or among-study variance.",
    "Observed buried and germinated fractions of recovered records share denominator; burial is a position, not a success transition or a direct measure of retention. Stage-gap contrast is descriptive, not mediation or proven failure to transmit.",
    "34 cores report more than nominal ten recovered records; per-ten scaling is not a probability. Strict subset selected on post-treatment recovery, sensitivity only.",
    "Simultaneous intervals use maximum standardized centered bootstrap error over five contrasts x three metrics, approximate conditional intervals, not exact randomized inference or prospective validation.",
    "Mixed treatment differs in animal composition/density from single-taxon arms; no general diversity effect or otter effect."
  ]
